OL,3,AJoin EU migration pact to tackle small
OL,4,Aboats, says Ed Davey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK should join the EU's new
OL,7,FMigration and Asylum Pact as a way of
OL,8,Ftackling small boat crossings across
OL,9,Fthe Channel, Liberal Democrat leader
OL,10,FSir Ed Davey has said.
OL,12,FThe agreement, which came into force in
OL,13,FJune, aims to speed up the asylum
OL,14,Fprocess, increase the number of
OL,15,Firregular migrants returned to their
OL,16,Fhome countries and spread
OL,17,Fresponsibility for asylum seekers
OL,18,Facross the EU.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
