OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJoin EU migration pact to tackle small
OL,4,Aboats, says Ed Davey
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Ed argues that signing up to the
OL,7,Fpact would allow the UK to return
OL,8,Fasylum seekers to the first EU country
OL,9,Fthey entered, thereby "destroying the
OL,10,Fbusiness model" of the gangs behind the
OL,11,Fcrossings.
OL,13,FLabour said the government's efforts to
OL,14,Fwork with European countries to tackle
OL,15,Fsmall boat crossings were "bearing
OL,16,Ffruit".
